---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="License — DiskPrune"
  description="A DiskPrune Personal license is a lifetime, non-exclusive license for up to three Macs. Scan is free. Cleanup requires activation."
>
  <main class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">License</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      A DiskPrune Personal license is a lifetime, non-exclusive license to run DiskPrune on
      up to three Macs you own or control. It is not a subscription.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Scan, autopsy, and explanations work without a license. Moving items to Trash requires
      an activated license with the cleanup entitlement.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      You may not redistribute the app, resell keys, or share a key beyond the seat limit.
      Release a Mac in Settings → Licence to free a seat.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      The software is provided as-is. DiskPrune only moves items you select to Trash after a
      dry-run confirmation. Emptying Trash is your action, in Finder.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
